<title>ZIMBABWE: Meikles Africa declares div, shr up.</title>
<headline>Meikles Africa declares div, shr up.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for yr to March 31 1997</p>
<p>		 (million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		161.0     vs    89.0</p>
<p>    Final div (cents)	 44.0     vs	--</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,092.7     vs 1,687.6</p>
<p>    Gross profit	     508.9     vs   388.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   199.1     vs    74.9</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	 198.6     vs    75.0</p>
<p>    Attrib profit	    183.6     vs    75.0</p>
<p>Full Name: Meikles Africa Limited</p>
<p>Note: The company said the current year had started well with developments planned for its three divisions. With the Zimbabwean economy continuing to perform strongly, the Meikles Africa board was confident that its strategy for the company would continue to deliver good progress.</p>
<p>--Stella Mapenzauswa, Harare Newsroom: 263-4 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
